{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手許志安今晚（19日）擔任無綫台慶壓軸表演嘉賓，無綫藝人馬國明也有出席台慶，兩人極有機會繼「安心事件」後首次同場。</p><p>許志安被問到有機會跟馬國明同場會否感尷尬時，他說：「我諗唔會，畢竟隔咗咁耐，唔想講番以前，順其自然。</p><p>（網民好關注你同馬國明同</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.594270+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.031989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:02.031989+00:00","content_hash":"e203a39cde7fa575cae65653e786a800c4718abcd9beab69f3a6846e2ea278be","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}